From 4eb95a0bc1d6a00ec008f26ae02c9ab6ad153ab5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:39:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Restore upstream licence notices on 20 Calibre-derived
 modules

These modules carry no licence header but match a specific calibre source
file on both defined names and code lines (compared against calibre 9.18).
Add a provenance comment naming the upstream file and its terms as stated
in calibre's COPYRIGHT file, with an SPDX identifier where upstream is
GPL v3 or Apache 2.0. Comment-only change: each file's AST is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FxjxHSWayX529W5vLbxsjy
